%N A128029 Numbers k such that (14^k - 3^k)/11 is prime.
%C A128029 All terms are primes.
%C A128029 There is no further term up to prime(1400) = 11657. - _Farideh Firoozbakht_, Apr 04 2007
%t A128029 k=11; Select[ Prime[ Range[1,200] ], PrimeQ[ ((k+3)^# - 3^#)/k ]& ]
%o A128029 (PARI) is(n)=isprime((14^n-3^n)/11) \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Feb 17 2017
